meta {
  name: Get Order
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/order/{{orderId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  Requires order-service/Create Order.bru to have run first (needs {{orderId}}), by the
  SAME user whose {{accessToken}} is sent here — OrderService.findById() throws
  OrderAccessDeniedException (403) if the token's email doesn't match order.userID and
  the token isn't ROLE_ADMIN. See order-service-errors/Get Order Forbidden.bru for the
  denied case with a second user.

  Expected: 200 OK with the order.
}
